{
  "_comment": [
    "Every string a declared MCP tool hands a model, as src/tollhouse/rules/tool_text.py reads it.",
    "Each case is a tools/list answer's tools and the (path, text) pairs the reader yields, in order. A schema",
    "keyword is spelled as it is, a name the tool's author chose sits in brackets, and a name or a key that is",
    "not an identifier is named by its position, so a path never carries prose. Copied from the Sigrix",
    "platform, which holds its own copy of the reader to the same table."
  ],
